From e9fde9d56dc41a1a720fdd7d584c3bd677347635 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 03:33:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 54/75] perf(wasm): packed batch_two_round_fold (IPA SRS fold)

Under WASM SIMD (and a = 0 curves), batch_two_round_fold replays its op schedule with every
coordinate column (lookup tables, accumulator, operand, scratch) held in packed VectorField
form for the whole schedule, using the packed batch_affine_add / batch_affine_double /
batch_invert kernels and a packed chord-only combined double-add. Points are packed once on
entry and unpacked once on exit. The native path is unchanged.
---
